<title>SOUTH KOREA: Seoul stock market closed for computer upgrade.</title>
<headline>Seoul stock market closed for computer upgrade.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-11-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Seoul stock market was closed on Saturday for an upgrade of its computer system, the Korea Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>Trading will resume on Monday.</p>
<p>The composite stock index closed Friday's session at 731.44 points, down 1.81 percent or 13.47 points on the day.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
